lain causes of behavior and avoid one-size-fits-all education.", "children": [{"id": "341e5386-6a9a-4e00-b23e-1f3d77ef430a", "type": "concept", "title": "Concepts and constructs"}, {"id": "6f909987-9b57-4ebe-8d61-48b51f7102ea", "type": "concept", "title": "Mechanisms of change"}, {"id": "4d3d0815-7f74-479c-991f-bd1ad8ecbf21", "type": "concept", "title": "Theory-driven questions"}, {"id": "94aa3a1c-6e70-4637-8974-263af9203dbc", "type": "concept", "title": "Program assumptions"}, {"id": "49571216-7fa9-4eda-b29f-1dea86e26f83", "type": "concept", "title": "Evidence fit"}]}, {"id": "9c0e936c-d2ce-4fa0-8c43-4edde5a8d73e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Theory selection", "description": "This subtopic teaches students to choose theories based on the behavior, audience, setting, and intervention level.", "children": [{"id": "164bab44-4e06-4c2d-bea0-7658a4b28a59", "type": "concept", "title": "Individual theories"}, {"id": "83d1d0a9-b555-4706-a26a-3509d4b89901", "type": "concept", "title": "Interpersonal theories"}, {"id": "0100c987-f170-4bdd-8ee0-fe72689feeaa", "type": "concept", "title": "Community theories"}, {"id": "4cb37fca-ed7f-459f-8a09-1695786e133f", "type": "concept", "title": "Organizational theories"}, {"id": "ec6abb46-2f16-4519-b07a-187c270f1a25", "type": "concept", "title": "Policy and ecological approaches"}]}, {"id": "447bfcdb-c42d-4fb5-8c60-075d31948bf8", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Theory to practice", "description": "Students practice turning theory into strategies, messages, activities, and evaluation measures.", "children": [{"id": "694e04a7-dd81-4e37-9d3c-07fe78e1649a", "type": "concept", "title": "Behavioral determinants"}, {"id": "eed1c53c-fd2a-4a2e-ac3b-db7461a39c70", "type": "concept", "title": "Change objectives"}, {"id": "1a4ec08f-4e70-499e-bdb5-654ab95e673a", "type": "concept", "title": "Methods and applications"}, {"id": "7df40bbe-a887-41be-9440-d219b055deeb", "type": "concept", "title": "Measurement indicators"}, {"id": "f77c31e2-af8d-4a31-aaf0-